    "steps": [
      "Rinse the scallions and trim each one, keeping the white part plus roughly 2 inches (5 cm) of the green stalk.",
      "Boil the scallions in a pot of water for about 5 minutes, until tender.",
      "Drain the scallions and chop them finely.",
      "Mix the scallions with the eggs, nutmeg, salt, pepper, bread crumbs and cold mashed potatoes in a medium bowl until uniform.",
      "Heat the olive oil and vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat until hot but not smoking.",
      "Shape the mixture into small patties, using two heaped tablespoons for each.",
      "Fry about 6 patties at a time for 2–3 minutes per side, flipping once, until golden brown on both faces.",
      "Keep the cooked cakes warm on a plate, loosely covered with foil, while you fry the rest.",
      "You nailed it! Grab a plate and dig in."
